<title>HONG KONG: S.Korea's Pusan Leasing Co sets US$40 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Pusan Leasing Co sets US$40 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger LTCB ASIA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PUSAN LEASING CO LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  PUSAN BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$40 MLN  COUPON     6ML+45     MATURITY 3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	  ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH   03.DEC.96</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	 CALLS	NONE	 REPLIES  20.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	 REPAYMENT  BULLET     DENOMS   US$250K</p>
<p> RATING     NONE	 SALE LMTS  STANDARD   TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    --	   CRS DEF    --	   FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  S.KOREA    GOV LAW    ENGLISH    SIGNING  30.DEC.96</p>
<p> PAY DATE   EARLY JAN.96 (TENTATIVE)</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p> CO-LEAD MGRS     US$5 MLN+    30BP  ALL-IN  55</p>
<p> MANAGERS	   US$2-4 MLN   27BP  ALL-IN  54</p>
<p> ARRANGERS   KDB ASIA, LTCB ASIA (BOOKS) AND SUMITOMO FINANCE</p>
<p>		 ASIA</p>
<p> NOTES   MAJOR SHAREHOLDERS OF THE ISSUER ARE PUSAN BANK</p>
<p>	   WITH 36.77 PCT AND KYONGNAM BANK</p>
<p>	   WITH 13.68 PCT.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
